			],
			"Message": "chore(Deps/Tauri): Advance PluginsWorkspace and TauriSearch submodules to latest upstream\n\nUpdate the Tauri dependency tree by advancing the PluginsWorkspace and TauriSearch submodules within the Dependency directory to their latest upstream revisions.\n\nPluginsWorkspace reformats HTML permission reference tables across dialog, fs, log, and shell plugins from expanded multi-line format to a consistent flat tab-indented structure, reducing whitespace while preserving all permission identifiers and descriptions. TauriSearch fixes malformed markup in seven pattern guide test fixtures (bridge.md, cloudbridge.md, cloudish.md, glui.md, hermit.md, lockdown.md, multiwin.md) by adding missing closing </rater> tags, ensuring fixture markup parses correctly in the tauri-search test suite.\n\nKeeps the Land editor's Tauri dependency tree aligned with upstream formatting improvements and bug fixes without altering semantic content.",
			"SHA": "3293b9b901211ec6daad60f9d313891a9907bb88"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-05T08:39:27Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				176,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Deps/Tauri): Advance Tauri Dependency submodule with permission table reformatting and TauriSearch fixture fixes\n\nUpdate the Dependency submodule within the Tauri dependency tree to upstream commit abc01a85, incorporating two sets of changes:\n\n**PluginsWorkspace:** Reformat HTML permission reference tables across dialog, fs, log, and shell plugins from flat tab-indented format to an expanded multi-line structure with blank line separation between cells. This continues the ongoing table formatting standardization while preserving all permission identifiers and descriptions exactly.\n\n**TauriSearch:** Fix malformed markup in seven pattern guide test fixtures (bridge.md, cloudbridge.md, cloudish.md, glui.md, hermit.md, lockdown.md, multiwin.md) by removing duplicate `</rater>` closing tags that created invalid nested closing tags. The `<rater value=\"X\">` opening tags now properly pair with a single closing `</rater>`, ensuring fixture markup parses correctly in the tauri-search test suite.\n\nKeeps the Land editor's Tauri dependency tree aligned with upstream formatting improvements and bug fixes without altering semantic content.",
			"SHA": "51c78073d2af506d6458c4f1d0cf7d7e597355c9"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-05T07:36:38Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				176,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Deps/Tauri): Advance Tauri dependency tree and regenerate ecosystem index\n\nUpdate the Tauri submodule from c0a5acc6 to 14db5761, incorporating two upstream changes:\n\n- Regenerate README.md with comprehensive Tauri ecosystem repository index covering 50+ CodeEditorLand forked repositories including plugins (Authenticator, CLI, Dialog, FS, Http, Log, Notification, OS, Positioner, Process, SQL, Shell, Stronghold, Updater, Upload, WebSocket), tooling (TauriAction, TauriBindgen, TauriCon, TauriDocs, TauriToml, Tao, Wry), and auxiliary modules (TauriSearch, TauriTheia, WebView, Window utilities).\n- Apply permission table formatting standardization across Tauri core crates (app, event, image, menu, path, resources, tray, webview, window) and PluginsWorkspace, converting multi-line HTML table rows to uniform single-line tab-indented format with significant file size reductions while preserving all permission identifiers and descriptions.\n\nKeeps the Land editor's Tauri dependency tree current with upstream maintenance and improves documentation discoverability without altering semantic content.",
			"SHA": "12a75132e724a7496699da3fcac130468c768961"
		},
